        "text": "<thinking> To create the `refresh_session.py` file that refreshes an expired session or access token using a concrete external provider, I will choose the Amazon Cognito service for this task. Amazon Cognito is a robust user management and authentication service that provides secure access to AWS resources and APIs. It is identifiable by the use of the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the specific client for Cognito Identity Provider. </thinking>\n",
