        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for signing in a user with email and password using a concrete external provider, I will use the Firebase Authentication service. Firebase Authentication provides backend services to authenticate users with passwords and other methods. The provider-specific integration code will include the Firebase Admin SDK, which is identifiable by the import statement and the use of Firebase-specific functions and constants. </thinking>\n",
