      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create a Python script that registers a new user account using an external provider, I need to choose a specific service. For this task, I will use the Firebase Authentication service, which is a concrete external provider. The script will import the Firebase Admin SDK, which is provider-specific, and will use the Firebase Authentication API to create a new user. </thinking>\n",
